<title>FRANCE: EU to hold July 1 Pakistan food aid tender.</title>
<headline>EU to hold July 1 Pakistan food aid tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union is holding a July 1 tender for the export of 12,895 tonnes of soft wheat to Pakistan as food aid, France's ONIC cereals office said.</p>
<p>It said details of the tender were contained in regulation 1096/97, published in the EU's Official Journal on June 17.</p>
</text>
